# At a table of three, Cruelclaw's Heist targets Bot3 while the gift is promised to Bot2 (CR 702.174a: the gifted opponent
# is chosen as an additional cost, the target is another choice). Bot2 draws the card (eight cards in hand), Bot3 does not
# (it loses the Lightning Bolt to the exile: six cards). Bot1 takes the Bolt from Bot3's revealed hand, casts it from exile
# with a Mox Pearl's white mana, and Bot3 is at 17 while Bot2 is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Cruelclaw's Heist
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cruelclaw's Heist.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot3)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
? Exile = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot3)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Count = 8
Bot3.Hand.Count = 6
Bot3.Life = 17
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot3.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
